        Total # of product terms : 7
        List of special equations: 
            Clock  = (\SPIM_3:Net_276\) => Global
            Clock Enable: True
        Main Equation            : 7 pterms
        !(
              !Net_1456 * !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_2\ * \SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_0\
            + !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_2\ * !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_1\ * 
              !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_0\
            + !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_2\ * !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:state_0\ * 
              !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:count_4\ * !\SPIM_3:BSPIM:count_3\ * 
